<title>EGYPT: Niger president in Cairo for talks with Mubarak.</title>
<headline>Niger president in Cairo for talks with Mubarak.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Niger's President General Ibrahim Bare Mainassara arrived in Cairo on Monday for talks with his Egyptian counterpart Hosni Mubarak, government officials said.</p>
<p>They said Mainassara would meet Mubarak on Tuesday to discuss African issues and ties between their two countries.</p>
